个、梨3个。输出一个JSON对象，顶层字段仅为items。items是数组，每项是含name字符串、count整数的对象。\n最外层必须保留上述字段名称，不能直接输出顶层字段的内部对象或数组。\n只输出合法JSON，不加Markdown或解释；字段不可增删，数组保持规定顺序。","reference_answer":"{\"items\": [{\"name\": \"苹果\", \"count\": 2}, {\"name\": \"梨\", \"count\": 3}]}","rules":{"array_matching":"ordered","expected":{"items":[{"count":2,"name":"苹果"},{"count":3,"name":"梨"}]},"fields":["/items/0/name","/items/0/count","/items/1/name","/items/1/count"],"json_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"items":{"items":false,"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"prefixItems":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer"},"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","count"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer"},"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","count"],"type":"object"}],"type":"array"}},"required":["items"],"type":"object"}}},{"case_id":"structured-04","category":"structured","prompt":"两次温度读数按顺序为零下2度、5度。输出一个JSON对象，顶层字段恰为readings和unit。readings是数值数组；unit是字符串“度”。\n最外层必须保留上述字段名称，不能直接输出顶层字段的内部对象或数组。\n只输出合法JSON，不加Markdown或解释；字段不可增删，数组保持规定顺序。","reference_answer":"{\"readings\": [-2, 5], \"unit\": \"度\"}","rules":{"array_matching":"ordered","expected":{"readings":[-2,5],"unit":"度"},"fields":["/readings/0","/readings/1","/unit"],"json_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"readings":{"items":false,"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"prefixItems":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"integer"}],"type":"array"},"unit":{"type":"string"}},"required":["readings","unit"],"type":"object"}}},{"case_id":"structured-05","category":"structured","prompt":"会议标题为周会，没有参会者。输出一个JSON对象，顶层字段仅为meeting。meeting是对象，含title字符串和attendees空数组。\n最外层必须保留上述字段名称，不能直接输出顶层字段的内部对象或数组。\n只输出合法JSON，不加Markdown或解释；字段不可增删，数组保持规定顺序。","reference_answer":"{\"meeting\": {\"title\": \"周会\", \"attendees\": []}}","rules":{"array_matching":"ordered","expected":{"meeting":{"attendees":[],"title":"周会"}},"fields":["/meeting/title","/meeting/attendees"],"json_schema":{"additionalP